{
  "an4.164:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.164 ",
  "an4.164:0.2": "17. Paṭipadāvagga ",
  "an4.164:0.3": "Paṭhamakhamasutta ",
  "an4.164:1.1": "“Catasso imā, bhikkhave, paṭipadā. ",
  "an4.164:1.2": "Katamā catasso? ",
  "an4.164:1.3": "Akkhamā paṭipadā, khamā paṭipadā, damā paṭipadā, samā paṭipadā. ",
  "an4.164:1.4": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, akkhamā paṭipadā? ",
  "an4.164:1.5": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco akkosantaṁ paccakkosati, rosantaṁ paṭirosati, bhaṇḍantaṁ paṭibhaṇḍati. ",
  "an4.164:1.6": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, akkhamā paṭipadā. ",
  "an4.164:2.1": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, khamā paṭipadā? ",
  "an4.164:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco akkosantaṁ na paccakkosati, rosantaṁ na paṭirosati, bhaṇḍantaṁ na paṭibhaṇḍati. ",
  "an4.164:2.3": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, khamā paṭipadā. ",
  "an4.164:3.1": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, damā paṭipadā? ",
  "an4.164:3.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu cakkhunā rūpaṁ disvā na nimittaggāhī hoti nānubyañjanaggāhī; ",
  "an4.164:3.3": "yatvādhikaraṇamenaṁ cakkhundriyaṁ asaṁvutaṁ viharantaṁ abhijjhādomanassā pāpakā akusalā dhammā anvāssaveyyuṁ, tassa saṁvarāya paṭipajjati; rakkhati cakkhundriyaṁ; cakkhundriye saṁvaraṁ āpajjati. ",
  "an4.164:3.4": "Sotena saddaṁ sutvā … ",
  "an4.164:3.5": "ghānena gandhaṁ ghāyitvā … ",
  "an4.164:3.6": "jivhāya rasaṁ sāyitvā … ",
  "an4.164:3.7": "kāyena phoṭṭhabbaṁ phusitvā … ",
  "an4.164: